(1. Title) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- TradeFlow AI. Track: Reinvent Commerce.) Tj
T*
(- Small cross-border sellers lose margin negotiating factory quotes alone, or pay an agent to do it.) Tj
T*
(- One operator. The engine sets the price. A human sends the offer.) Tj
T*
(- Prototype. No factory has closed a deal through this.) Tj
T*
(- Public repo: https://github.com/Fu93/tradeflow-ai. License: MIT.) Tj
T*
ET
