(2. Problem) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Cross-border buyers either negotiate alone, often with a language penalty, or pay an agent.) Tj
T*
(- TradeFlow is a prototype of a third arrangement: one operator, software doing the arithmetic, the person keeping the send button.) Tj
T*
(- It is not a deployed company and it has not bought from a real factory.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
