(4. Split) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Hybrid desk. The criteria this workflow is written for are Hybrid, Becreatives, and Vibe Generation.) Tj
T*
(- Solver decides. The decision core does not ask a language model what to pay.) Tj
T*
(- Model phrases. An optional call can classify a message or draft wording.) Tj
T*
(- Human sends. The Chrome extension \(Manifest V3\) shows a card. It cannot press Send.) Tj
T*
(- Code: src/engine/solver.py, src/engine/multi_solver.py, extension/.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
