(5. Decision core) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- A belief about the supplier reserve, then a vectorised Expectimax search over openings and concession curves.) Tj
T*
(- Read the recommended price and the breakdown probability off the dashboard you just captured.) Tj
T*
(- This slide does not state a latency. Use the number on the screen.) Tj
T*
ET
