(7. AMD compute layer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- TRADEFLOW_SOLVER_BACKEND selects NumPy \(default\) or a CuPy/ROCm request.) Tj
T*
(- results/bench.json is a CPU measurement \(is_gpu_active: false\).) Tj
T*
(- The MI300X column is a theoretical roofline lower-bound estimate, not measured.) Tj
T*
(- Formula: lower_bound_seconds = \(working_set_mb * 1024 * 1024\) / \(5.3e12\).) Tj
T*
(- No AMD GPU measurement is in the repo unless a sibling benchmark JSON says ran_on_amd_gpu: true. Do not narrate a speedup.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
