(9. Limits and roadmap) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- cp .env.example .env && docker compose up --build, then open http://localhost:8000. render.yaml is the public-demo blueprint. No hostname is claimed) Tj
T*
(until a deploy exists.) Tj
T*
(- Placeholder keys are ignored. /health reports offline_demo and the solver backend. AMD live mode stays off unless a real VLLM_API_KEY is set and the) Tj
T*
(operator turns it on.) Tj
T*
(- No factory deal. No shipped MI300X timing. No committed Gemma latency. MIT. Public repo.) Tj
T*
(- Roadmap: keep the human on the send button, log a real Gemma chat only when a key is present, and publish extraction accuracy only after that log) Tj
T*
(exists.) Tj
T*
(- Working deadline used for this pack: 11:00 London \(BST\), 18 October 2026. Confirm the form.) Tj
